msgctxt "92"
msgid ""
"There's a legendary tattoo artist right here in Kamurocho. They say he's the"
" one who did the tattoo on the Dragon of Dojima's back."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "104"
msgid ""
"Whoa, you serious? I didn't even know we had a tattoo parlor here. I've "
"never seen a sign or nothing."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "116"
msgid ""
"It's some building called the <Color:7>Divine Dragon<Color:Default>. I "
"remember seeing it in a <Color:7>back alley just off Pink "
"Street<Color:Default>. But apparently we can't get in without an invitation."
" Ain't that some shit?"
msgstr ""

